The [b]__init__[/b] method creates the [b]adj[/b] matrix with the given size (number of vertices) and initializes all values to zeros.
The [b]add_edge[/b]() method is used to add an edge by setting the corresponding values to 1.
Similarly, the [b]remove_edge[/b]() method sets the values to 0.
